sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The Test System will always reject the message,<br>but normally this would only occur if the set severity level is out of range
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Instruct CSMS to set a monitoring level with severity = 4
    CSMS->>CS: SetMonitoringLevelRequest (severity = 4)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: Message SetMonitoringLevelRequest with severity = 4

    CS-->>CSMS: SetMonitoringLevelResponse (status = Rejected)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/A
